    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-3xl">China Travel Essentials</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-stone-500">The stuff that stresses people out about visiting China. We've done the research so you don't have to.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/china-visa" class="group rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">China Visa Guide</h3>
