        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Internet and eSIM</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-500">Travel eSIMs route through Hong Kong — no VPN needed for Instagram and WhatsApp. $5-15 for 7-day plans. Local SIMs need a VPN.</p>
